---
description: Grok bots manage. Cursor agents build, test, and check.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Grok bots are managers and admins. They talk to Beau, research, write `brief.md`, and accept or reject finished work.
- Cursor agents are workers only: `builder` → `tester` → `security` → `ui`. They do not plan, research, or approve releases.
- Work from a job ticket in `factory/jobs/<id>/`. Do not start building until the brief is ready.
- If the brief is missing or unclear, stop and send it back to the Grok bot. Do not guess.
- After `test-failed`, `security-failed`, `ui-failed`, or `changes-requested`, the builder implements the existing brief unless a Grok bot updated it.
- `security` and `ui` report only. They do not rewrite the feature.
